Substituting different artwork
------------------------------

LGPL-3.0 requires that recipients be able to replace the covered work with a
modified or alternative version. Two things make that practical here:

  * The unmodified vector source is retained in this repository, so the artwork
    can be edited rather than only redistributed.

  * Card artwork is resolved through the key returned by playingCardFaceKey()
    in src/engine/core/card/playing_card.ts, so replacing a deck is a matter of
    supplying atlas frames under the same keys. No engine or game code binds to
    a particular set of card faces.

To substitute a deck: replace the vector source, run `yarn build:atlas` to
regenerate the atlas pages, and update this file to record the new artwork's
provenance and license.
